+
+/* [CAIOS] A catalogue entry this cluster cannot host. Dimmed and inert, not
+   hidden — the capability exists, the hardware does not. pointer-events:none
+   is what actually stops the card's routerLink firing; the opacity is only
+   what says so. */
+.demo-unavailable-card {
+    opacity: 0.45;
+    filter: grayscale(1);
+    pointer-events: none;
+    cursor: not-allowed;
+}
